POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "{{createDoctor.response.body.$.doctor.id}}",
  "serviceId": "{{createService.response.body.$.service.id}}",
  "startsAt": "{{nextMonday}}T09:07:00-06:00"
}

### Start without time zone → 400
# Inicio sin zona horaria → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "{{createDoctor.response.body.$.doctor.id}}",
  "serviceId": "{{createService.response.body.$.service.id}}",
  "startsAt": "{{nextMonday}}T09:00:00"
}

