POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{doctorEmail}}", "password": "{{doctorPassword}}" }

### Doctor sees their agenda → 200
# El médico ve su agenda → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments

### Doctor tries to book → 403
# El médico intenta agendar → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "{{createDoctor.response.body.$.doctor.id}}",
  "serviceId": "{{createService.response.body.$.service.id}}",
