### Patient login → 200
# Login de paciente → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{patientEmail}}", "password": "{{patientPassword}}" }

### Patient uploads an external lab result → 201 (status: pending_review)
# La paciente sube un estudio externo → 201 (status: pending_review)
# @name patientAttachment
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{registerPatient.response.body.$.patient.id}}/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MedicalApiBoundary

--MedicalApiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

lab_result
--MedicalApiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Química sanguínea de laboratorio externo
--MedicalApiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Química sanguínea.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-lab-result.pdf
--MedicalApiBoundary--

### A text file renamed to .pdf → 415 (the content is checked, not the name)
# Un archivo de texto renombrado a .pdf → 415 (se revisa el contenido, no el nombre)
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{registerPatient.response.body.$.patient.id}}/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MedicalApiBoundary

--MedicalApiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="resultado.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./README.md
--MedicalApiBoundary--

