### Patient tries to review it → 403 (only the treating doctor)
# La paciente intenta revisarlo → 403 (solo el médico tratante)
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{registerPatient.response.body.$.patient.id}}/attachments/{{patientAttachment.response.body.$.attachment.id}}/review

### Employee login → 200
# Login de empleado → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{employeeEmail}}", "password": "{{employeePassword}}" }

### Front desk uploads a scanned study → 201 (status: pending_review)
# Recepción sube un estudio escaneado → 201 (status: pending_review)
# @name employeeAttachment
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{registerPatient.response.body.$.patient.id}}/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MedicalApiBoundary

